  message: "Not reproducible since the original occurrence on 2026-04-06. All recent tracker auto-sync commits (10+ since 2026-04-08) contain actual file changes. The empty-diff commit was likely a one-time race condition. The stale PR (#2729) was manually closed. Will reopen if the issue recurs."  # ccb8
